28\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 1854 ---\nComponent: Availability Service\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Enabled certificate validation for Expsrvpush URL monitors\nDescription: AvS added an option to toggle certificate validation for Expsrvpush URL monitors (for example, to support PKI scenarios). For more information, see  ?sap-ot O2O class=\"- topic/xref \" href=\"643030f616404d21babdd9a12e1911b5.xml\" text=\"\" desc=\"\" xtrc=\"xref:5\" xtrf=\"file:/home/builder/src/dita-all/yoe1460360436347/loio922bf2dbe0b646aaaa8cb5e077cfd799_en-US/src/content/localization/en-us/6da9927f396a47609f58c262831b0d9e.xml\" output-class=\"xref\" outputTopicFile=\"file:/home/builder/tp.net.sf.dita-ot/2.3/plugins/com.sap.prd.dita.html5/xsl/sap-html5/sap-html5-table-json.xsl\" ? . Existing evaluations are not affected by the change.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Announcement\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-11-28\nValid as Of: 2024-11-28\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 1855 ---\nComponent: Availability Service\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: New APIs for tagging\nDescription: The new set of APIs for tagging (v2/tagclass) are added to AvS.  The current APIs for tagging (v1/tagclass) are marked as deprecated and will be removed in 180 days.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Announcement\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-11-28\nValid as Of: 2024-11-28\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 1856 ---\nComponent: Cloud Logging\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Cloud Logging service is now available in IL30\nDescription: The Cloud Logging service is now available in IL30\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Announcement\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-11-28\nValid as Of: 2024-11-28\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 1857 ---\nComponent: Cloud Logging\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Update OpenSearch and OpenSearch Dashboards to 1.3.19\nDescription: We have updated the OpenSearch and OpenSearch Dashboards to 1.3.19\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Announcement\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-11-28\nValid as Of: 2024-11-28\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 1858 ---\nComponent: Document Management Service\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Availability in Additional Regions\nDescription: SAP Document Management Service is now available in the following regions:       Brazil (São Paulo) (cf-br20) - Microsoft Azure  Australia (Sydney) (cf-ap30) - Google Cloud      See information available on the  SAP Discovery Center.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Changed\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-11-28\nValid as Of: 2024-11-28\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 1859 ---\nComponent: SAP Alert Notification Service\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: New SAP Enterprise Threat Detection, cloud edition section and event.\nDescription: You can now use the newly supported SAP Enterprise Threat Detection, cloud edition event - Logs Received In The Last Hour. For more information, see SAP", ": Changed\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-11-28\nValid as Of: 2024-11-28\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 1859 ---\nComponent: SAP Alert Notification Service\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: New SAP Enterprise Threat Detection, cloud edition section and event.\nDescription: You can now use the newly supported SAP Enterprise Threat Detection, cloud edition event - Logs Received In The Last Hour. For more information, see SAP Enterprise Threat Detection, Cloud Edition Events section page.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-11-28\nValid as Of: 2024-11-28\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 1860 ---\nComponent: SAP BTP Command Line Interface\nEnvironment: ABAP,Cloud Foundry,Kyma,Neo,Other\nTitle: Changes to Maximum Session Length\nDescription: When you log in with the btp CLI, t